---
alt: "Santashop public app workflow"
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Santashop public app workflow
    accDescr: Major user journey through landing, sign-up or sign-in, pre-registration, submission, confirmation, and check-in lockout

    Start[Home page] --> CreateGate{createAccountEnabled?}
    CreateGate -->|Yes| SignUp[Sign-up page]
    CreateGate -->|No or existing user| SignIn[Sign-in page]

    SignUp --> NewAccount[newAccount callable]
    NewAccount --> UserDoc[("users/{uid}")]
    NewAccount --> RegistrationDoc[("registrations/{uid}")]
    NewAccount --> QRStorage[("Storage: registrations/{uid}.png")]
    NewAccount --> AutoLogin[Firebase Auth login]

    SignIn --> Login[Firebase Auth login]
    AutoLogin --> Shell[Pre-registration shell]
    Login --> Shell

    Shell --> Overview[Overview page]
    Overview --> Referral[Optional referral save]
    Referral --> UpdateReferral[updateReferredBy callable]
    UpdateReferral --> UserDoc

    Overview --> Children[Children page]
    Children --> AddChild[Add/edit child page]
    AddChild --> SaveChildren[Direct registration save]
    SaveChildren --> RegistrationDoc

    Overview --> Slot[Date-time page]
    Slot --> SaveSlot[Direct registration save]
    SaveSlot --> RegistrationDoc

    Overview --> Submit[Submit page]
    Submit --> CompleteRegistration[completeRegistration callable]
    CompleteRegistration --> RegistrationDoc
    CompleteRegistration --> SearchIndex[("registrationsearchindex/{uid}")]
    CompleteRegistration --> EmailQueue[("tmp_registrationemails/{uid}")]
    EmailQueue --> EmailTrigger[sendNewRegistrationEmails trigger]

    CompleteRegistration --> Confirmation[Confirmation page]
    Confirmation --> ViewQR[Read QR image]
    ViewQR --> QRStorage

    Confirmation --> ChangeSlot{allowChangeRegistration and not checked in?}
    ChangeSlot -->|Yes| ChangeCallable[changeRegistrationDateTime callable]
    ChangeCallable --> RegistrationDoc
    ChangeCallable --> EmailQueue

    Confirmation --> EventInfo[Event information page]
    Shell --> Profile[Profile page]
    Profile --> ChangeInfo[Change info]
    ChangeInfo --> ChangeInfoFn[changeAccountInformation callable]
    ChangeInfoFn --> UserDoc
    ChangeInfoFn --> RegistrationDoc
    ChangeInfoFn --> SearchIndex

    Profile --> ChangeEmail[Change email]
    ChangeEmail --> UpdateEmailFn[updateEmailAddress callable]
    UpdateEmailFn --> UserDoc
    UpdateEmailFn --> RegistrationDoc
    UpdateEmailFn --> SearchIndex

    Profile --> ChangePassword[Change password]
    ChangePassword --> PasswordAuth[Firebase Auth updatePassword]

    Reset[Reset password page] --> ResetAuth[Firebase Auth sendPasswordResetEmail]

    AdminCheckIn[Admin check-in flow] --> CheckinDoc[("checkins/{uid}")]
    CheckinDoc --> CheckinObserver[CheckinService observes document]
    CheckinObserver --> Logout[Alert, logout, reload]

    GlobalFlags[(parameters/public)] --> Overlay{blocking overlay?}
    Overlay -->|maintenance| Maintenance[Maintenance page modal]
    Overlay -->|weather| Weather[Bad weather page modal]
    Overlay -->|registration off| Closed[Registration closed page modal]
